<LegalPage title="18+ notice" eyebrow="Before you read" description="Dark Romance Fan is for adult readers only. Dark romance deals with disturbing themes; here's how we handle content notes and spoilers.">
  <p><strong>Dark Romance Fan is for adults aged 18 and over.</strong> By using the site, commenting or joining the newsletter, you confirm that you are 18 or older.</p>

  <h2>What dark romance can include</h2>
  <p>The books on this site are fiction written for adults. Many deal with themes some readers will find disturbing, such as violence, stalking, kidnapping and captivity, coercion, dubious or non-consent, abuse, self-harm and death. Featuring a book is not an endorsement of anything that happens in it.</p>

  <h2>Content notes</h2>
  <p>Where we know of them, books carry content notes on their pages. They aren't complete, and an author's own warnings come first, so check those before you start a book if anything is a hard limit for you.</p>

  <h2>What we don't publish</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Explicit excerpts. Blurbs and lists describe books without graphic detail.</li>
    <li>Books whose romantic leads are under 18.</li>
    <li>Explicit or abusive comments. Comments are moderated, and big spoilers must be hidden with ||double bars||.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Look after yourself</h2>
  <p>If something you read brings up difficult feelings, step away and talk to someone you trust. In the UK, Samaritans are available on 116 123; in the US, call or text 988.</p>
</LegalPage>
